#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:895
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:924
msgid "Request HTTP Headers"
msgstr "Requête d'en-têtes HTTP"

#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2051
msgid "HTTP headers to include in the API request. You can use `{{ q }}` for the search term and `{{ variables.name }}` for referencing variables and `{{ secrets.name }}` for secrets."
msgstr "Entêtes HTTP à inclure dans la requête API. Vous pouvez utiliser `{{ q }}` pour les termes à rechercher, `{{ variables.name }}` pour les variables référencées et `{{ secrets.name }}` pour les éléments secrets."

#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2054
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2450
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:688
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:717
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:775
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:816
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:896
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:925
msgid "Request HTTP Body"
msgstr "Requête du corps HTTP"

#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2058
msgid "Optional request body of the API request. You can again use `{{ q }}` for the search term and `{{ variables.name }}` for referencing variables and `{{ secrets.name }}` for secrets."
msgstr "Corps optionnel pour la requête API. Vous pouvez là encore utiliser `{{ q }}` pour les termes à rechercher, `{{ variables.name }}` pour les variables référencées et `{{ secrets.name }}` pour les éléments secrets."

#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2061
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2458
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:689
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:776
#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:897
msgid "Allow Empty Search"
msgstr "Autoriser la recherche non renseignée"

#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2065
msgid "If enabled, the API request will be sent even if the user does not enter a search term. This is useful for APIs that return a default set of results when no search term is provided."
msgstr "Si activé, la requête API sera envoyée même si l'utilisateur ne saisit pas de terme de recherche. Cela est utile pour les API qui renvoient un ensemble de résultats par défaut lorsqu'aucun terme de recherche n'est fourni."

#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2071
msgid "Advanced Request Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration avancée des requêtes"

#: engine-wizard/elm/Wizard/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2080
